        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "0c4700f2-cb2e-36a4-8100-9a53cabdb0a8",
                "word": "инкогнито",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5bdb397-1e80-3fbf-ab78-242d22583cfb",
                        "entry_id": "0c4700f2-cb2e-36a4-8100-9a53cabdb0a8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "анонимно или под вымышленным именем; сохраняя тайну своей личности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a319a122-95b3-4225-9c37-c9d98c16e11d",
                                "sense_id": "c5bdb397-1e80-3fbf-ab78-242d22583cfb",
                                "text": "Во главе посольства стал Лефорт и Фёдор Головин; сам Пётр I был членом посольства и путешествовал инкогнито под именем Петра Михайлова."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d968e7b1-6a5d-478e-9187-64bbed4947db",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c4700f2-cb2e-36a4-8100-9a53cabdb0a8",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5bdb397-1e80-3fbf-ab78-242d22583cfb",
                        "target_lang_word": "incognito",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incognito",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92d145b1-d96c-3b2c-a791-c3c4f18c4489",
                                        "entry_id": "f442e83c-0d67-3886-a11b-9ad66f7b300f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without being known; in an assumed character, or under an assumed title; in disguise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1db4405f-9cd1-42d6-ac5a-ebf07edfc56d",
                                                "sense_id": "92d145b1-d96c-3b2c-a791-c3c4f18c4489",
                                                "text": "THE Scepticks think 'twas long ago, / Since Gods came down Incognito; / To ſee who were their Friends or Foes, / And how our Actions fell or roſe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incognito",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab8439ac-a279-3fc4-9cec-9cd1dc4c43ac",
                                        "entry_id": "c2a2d360-aef5-31d3-a9f1-5c211a8d2405",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without revealing one's identity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d563eb45-9e69-45a3-b271-7d93c0a490c0",
                                                "sense_id": "ab8439ac-a279-3fc4-9cec-9cd1dc4c43ac",
                                                "text": "The prince royal of Prussia came thither incognito."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a6ef004-2028-4b5c-919b-36cf36694ca6",
                                                "sense_id": "ab8439ac-a279-3fc4-9cec-9cd1dc4c43ac",
                                                "text": "\"But you can understand,\" said our strange visitor, sitting down once more and passing his hand over his high white forehead, \"you can understand that I am not accustomed to doing such business in my own person. Yet the matter was so delicate that I could not confide it to an agent without putting myself in his power. I have come incognito from Prague for the purpose of consulting you.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incognito",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58fdf521-f781-34d0-8341-313eebb0ec10",
                                        "entry_id": "b3e4bb7d-b987-3dd7-b77c-b94763618e7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One unknown or in disguise, or under an assumed character or name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c75e422c-1c4e-3cc8-b98e-e96433d9a2c1",
                                        "entry_id": "b3e4bb7d-b987-3dd7-b77c-b94763618e7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The assumption of disguise or of a feigned character; the state of being in disguise or not recognized."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f5caa18-aa2e-409e-a7d3-baa79dc9e33f",
                                                "sense_id": "c75e422c-1c4e-3cc8-b98e-e96433d9a2c1",
                                                "text": "Of those letters, and other attempts of the same kind, the author could not complain, though his incognito was endangered. He had challenged the public to a game at bo-peep, and if he was discovered in his “hiding-hole,” he must submit to the shame of detection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46324590-2086-4de0-b3c6-0c7fccddc8ba",
                                                "sense_id": "c75e422c-1c4e-3cc8-b98e-e96433d9a2c1",
                                                "text": "It contained a letter from the King himself, craving hospitality for a few days, as his mother was about to visit England, and to take up with Lord Avonleigh her residence at the Castle. A slight incognito would be preserved, and as little form and ceremony expected as was possible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
